| 4h | RIGHT AFTER (ruled 2026-11-18) | genesis as floors (#/rulings, 2026-11-18: D1, D2, its three additions, the moʻolelo, the Nexus default; <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/w26-floor-lane`>>): contact reads on the real house; one boot line naming the pinned floor beside the offered seed field by field, and the seed witness pinned for every seed source; the protect report and `/bulb` reading the stored island; the shadow read at mount; a floor format whose fields resolve to bytes (every floor CID moves, one genesis re-bake, Lares-Alpha baking); the flip once the operator's own house reads clean; adopt per ratchet as a `LocalFloor` beside the `ReleaseFloor`, its undo a forward revert, a release accept reading descent from the local floor's base; the whole-document merge (`reconcileGenesisCid`) retiring, its two-bakes reds (PR #225) carried into the adopt's tests; oracle to floor. Holder: Lares-Awakens (backlog-awakens Waves 0 to 3) | A standing house's island acts as a second registry beside its floor pin, and the floor manifest's fields go unread; the ruled shape moves only the pin. |

